        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Keith Moon\n- Publications: Modern Drummer, Bookmarks, Rolling Stone\n- Products: Two Sides of the Moon\n- Roles: drummers, percussionists\n\nFacts:\n- Modern Drummer is a monthly publication targeting the interests of drummers and percussionists.\n- Bookmarks is a bimonthly American literary magazine dedicated to general readers, book groups, and librarians.\n- In 1982, Keith Moon was posthumously inducted into the Modern Drummer Hall of Fame as only the second rock drummer chosen.\n- Two Sides of the Moon is the debut and only solo album by Keith Moon, the English rock musician and drummer for the Who.\n- In 2011, Keith Moon was voted the second-greatest drummer in history in a Rolling Stone readers' poll.",
